# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:578
translate schinese President_Talk_02_5aede983:

    # ap "Oh, I'm sure you can think of a few things, Mr. [mc]. Let's not pretend you don't have quite a few ideas on that head of yours."
    ap "哦，我敢肯定你能想出好几件事，[mc] 先生。别装作你脑子里没那么多主意。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:579
translate schinese President_Talk_02_d9c2e5fa:

    # ap "But I was thinking of something that would count as a step towards her eventual degeneration."
    ap "不过我想的是某种能算作「她最终堕落」第一步的东西。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:596
translate schinese President_Talk_02_ed8c513f:

    # ap "It has come to my attention that you and some of the girls have already ventured into the more unconventional approaches to intercourse."
    ap "我听说，你和其中一些女孩已经尝试过更非常规的性交方式了。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:598
translate schinese President_Talk_02_e1af5262:

    # ap "Tell me; How familiar are you with the more unconventional approaches to intercourse?"
    ap "告诉我，你对那些更非常规的性交方式有多熟悉？"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:599
translate schinese President_Talk_02_18e02b73:

    # ap "To be more specific, about the use of the 'backdoor', for lack of the better word."
    ap "更具体地说，是关于使用「后门」——姑且这么说。"

