# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:620
translate schinese President_Talk_02_179e95ca:

    # ap "It may not be the most degenerate act you can think of, I'm sure of that. However, she hasn't yet had any substantial sexual interaction. In my humble opinion, that is."
    ap "我敢肯定那不是你能想到的最堕落的举动。不过，依我拙见，她确实还没有过任何实质性的性互动。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:621
translate schinese President_Talk_02_a038ae97:

    # ap "I believe it would be an spectacular interaction to include it in her 'first time' on our cameras."
    ap "我相信把这件事放进她在镜头前的「第一次」里，会是一场极为精彩的互动。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:626
translate schinese President_Talk_02_d1793742:

    # mc "It's not really my thing, so no promises."
    mc "这不是我的专长，所以我可不敢保证。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:628
translate schinese President_Talk_02_ed6e756f:

    # ap "Understandable."
    ap "可以理解。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:629
translate schinese President_Talk_02_7de14535:

    # ap "As long as you can make it entertaining, I'm sure the Board will be satisfied with it nonetheless."
    ap "只要你能弄得足够有看头，我相信理事会照样会满意。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:630
translate schinese President_Talk_02_d286f185:

    # ap "That particular act is just a highly requested suggestion."
    ap "那个特定举动只是个被强烈请求的建议而已。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:633
translate schinese President_Talk_02_83495ed0:

    # mc "I understand."
    mc "我明白了。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:638
translate schinese President_Talk_02_25d9d354:

    # ap "On any occasion, remember the hint I gave you earlier about [sou]. Maybe he can be a useful 'card' to play in this instance. Consider it carefully." with dquick
    ap "无论何时，都记得我之前关于 [sou] 的提示。也许在这件事上他能成为一张有用的「牌」。好好考虑。" with dquick

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:651
translate schinese President_Talk_02_c9482467:

    # ap "I am certain you will not disappoint. I look forward to it."
    ap "我相信你不会让我失望。我很期待。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:653
translate schinese President_Talk_02_49d84b4a:

    # ap "And, of course, keep up the good work. The Board is quite pleased with your recent performance."
    ap "当然，继续保持。理事会对你近期的表现相当满意。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:655
translate schinese President_Talk_02_628e0b88:

    # ap "While you have been a good asset to the project, this is a great opportunity to further increase the Board's satisfaction and solidify your position at the Academy."
    ap "既然你一直是这个项目的得力资产，这是个极好的机会，能进一步提升理事会的满意度，并巩固你在学院的地位。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:661
translate schinese President_Talk_02_933be808:

    # ap "And remember that your position as the Chief Academic Officer {i}can{/i} be revoked if you continue to display a poor performance in the Board's eyes"
    ap "还有记住，如果你继续在理事会眼中表现不佳，你教务主任的职位{i}随时{/i}可能被撤销"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:662
translate schinese President_Talk_02_187e526d:

    # ap "Consider this as an opportunity to remedy the situation."
    ap "把这当成一个弥补的机会。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:664
translate schinese President_Talk_02_96b90ac6:

    # ap "Until next time, Mr. [mc]."
    ap "下次再见，[mc] 先生。"

# game/new scripts/008/mc_president_talk.rpy:666
translate schinese President_Talk_02_cb843a92:

    # ap "And I hope you don't dissapoint us this time."
    ap "希望这一次你别让我们失望。"

